prompts.feedback_preamble:
A previous attempt at this was reviewed and scored below the required standard. The reviewer said:

{feedback}

Address that specifically. Do not simply reword the previous attempt, and do not add items to look thorough — if the objection is that something was unsupported, the fix may be to leave it out.

